    {
      "text": "By baring its fangs and making a scary face, Snubbull sends smaller Pokémon scurrying away in terror. However, this Pokémon seems a little sad at making its foes flee.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Despite its intimidating face, it’s quite cowardly. Its desperate attempts to appear threatening make it popular with people.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its growls make its opponents uneasy. This laid-back Pokémon tends to sleep half the day.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It grows close to others easily and is also easily spoiled. The disparity between its face and its actions makes many young people wild about it.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "In contrast to its appearance, it’s quite timid. When playing with other puppy Pokémon, it sometimes gets bullied.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    }
